{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS GAME IS A WORK IN PROGRESS<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/c65434c9e7bcb46374db12ea4a546677.avif?t=1726845157\" width=600 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the captain of a pirate ship and collect the cards of crew, weapons and magical loot in this fantastical naval combat deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/4a000a592ab9c5a8dabbdfcbab24e6e2.avif?t=1726845157\" width=600 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick travel on procedurally generated map routes or break off to avoid a tough battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/a859da5cb14524fd1e6f81d7ec6b8721.avif?t=1726845157\" width=600 height=83 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.poster.avif?t=1726845157\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.webm?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669750/extras/0af887d2709011363ec0ae732e442c9c.mp4?t=1726845157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in and take the helm to skillfully sail in a beautiful stylized world and command directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_